      ],
      "actual_refresh": [],
      "eligible": "YES",
      "purpose_api": "matplotlib.use; np.random.seed; dict; FFMpegWriter; plt.figure; plt.plot; plt.xlim; plt.ylim; writer.saving; range; l.set_data; writer.grab_frame; np.random.randn",
      "purpose_visual": "Frame grabbing — Use a MovieWriter directly to grab individual frames and write them to a file. This avoids any event loop integration, and thus works even with the Agg backend. This is not recommended for use in an interactive setting. Gallery generated by Sphinx-Gallery",
